WEBVTT

00:00:03.100 --> 00:00:05.100
Seeing all those people so excited about

00:00:05.100 --> 00:00:07.730
the song they were hearing from the rooftop...

00:00:08.940 --> 00:00:14.450
It made me want to go down
the uncharted path myself.

00:00:17.450 --> 00:00:18.780
What do you wanna do?

00:00:20.290 --> 00:00:21.910
Should we go for it?

00:00:24.460 --> 00:00:27.250
I want to give it a try.

00:00:27.250 --> 00:00:30.250
I want to try, too.

00:00:31.760 --> 00:00:33.550
Hiyah!

00:00:33.550 --> 00:00:36.260
You haven't won yet, Senpai!

00:00:37.510 --> 00:00:40.260
We got some extra chairs.

00:00:40.260 --> 00:00:43.350
Ooh, it's looking nice and clean.

00:00:43.350 --> 00:00:46.020
I think that should do it.

00:00:46.020 --> 00:00:49.190
We're not done yet. There's one last thing.

00:00:51.030 --> 00:00:52.940
We're finally back.

00:00:52.940 --> 00:00:56.030
--All right, let's officially restart
the School Idol Club!

00:00:56.030 --> 00:00:58.120
--Heya!

00:00:58.120 --> 00:01:01.790
Do you guys belong to the School Idol Club?

00:01:01.790 --> 00:01:05.210
We do. You two are...

00:01:05.210 --> 00:01:08.170
I'm a second-year in the information
processing course, Ai Miyashita!

00:01:08.170 --> 00:01:12.250
Likewise, but first-year, Rina Tennoji.

00:01:12.250 --> 00:01:14.050
Hey, you helped us out the other day.

00:01:14.050 --> 00:01:16.720
So you guys joined the School Idol Club!

00:01:16.720 --> 00:01:23.140
You see, we were totally moved by
that rooftop performance the other day...

00:01:24.180 --> 00:01:26.480
I know, right?! It must've
just grabbed your heart!

00:01:26.480 --> 00:01:28.850
Yeah, it did!

00:01:28.850 --> 00:01:31.270
It was really amazing.

00:01:31.270 --> 00:01:34.190
Th-Thank you very much.

00:01:35.530 --> 00:01:38.780
So yeah, we want to join.

00:01:39.780 --> 00:01:41.780
We welcome you with open arms!

00:01:41.780 --> 00:01:46.410
Since I'm doing this, I'm totally
committed! I'll help you guys out.

00:01:46.410 --> 00:01:50.960
So, what does a School Idol Club do anyway?

00:01:50.960 --> 00:01:52.210
Huh?

00:01:52.210 --> 00:01:57.550
Well... We're actually trying to
figure that out right now.

00:02:00.010 --> 00:02:06.230
<i>Let's go to the future!</i>
<i>Rainbow melodies</i>

00:02:08.520 --> 00:02:11.520
"Nijigasaki High School Idol Club"
"Love Live!"

00:02:16.360 --> 00:02:18.990
<i>The rain clears up and reveals blue skies</i>

00:02:18.990 --> 00:02:21.990
<i>The winds of hope blow (Blowing)</i>

00:02:21.990 --> 00:02:26.910
<i>We can feel something coming</i>
<i>and we take our very first step</i>

00:02:26.910 --> 00:02:29.670
<i>The world is sparkling</i>

00:02:29.670 --> 00:02:32.670
<i>And our hearts start to well up with (Feelings)</i>

00:02:32.670 --> 00:02:37.050
<i>"We want to start running right now!!"</i>
<i>(Move on! Move on!)</i>

00:02:37.050 --> 00:02:42.550
<i>The tiny melodies blend together (Our Colors)</i>

00:02:42.550 --> 00:02:44.760
<i>Let's paint this arch, now</i>

00:02:44.760 --> 00:02:48.350
<i>It resonates throughout the city</i>
<i>(Reaching for far blue sky!)</i>

00:02:48.350 --> 00:02:50.520
<i>Let's sing together!</i>

00:02:50.520 --> 00:02:56.320
<i>My feelings are overflowing,</i>
<i>there's no stopping them now</i>

00:02:56.320 --> 00:02:58.990
<i>Rainbow-colored passions!!</i>

00:02:58.990 --> 00:03:01.200
<i>Colors painted in courage</i>

00:03:01.200 --> 00:03:03.870
<i>Let's create a bridge to the future</i>

00:03:03.870 --> 00:03:07.330
<i>Beyond the endless sky</i>

00:03:07.330 --> 00:03:09.660
<i>Resounding sympathy</i>

00:03:09.660 --> 00:03:12.040
<i>Miracles are blooming</i>

00:03:12.040 --> 00:03:15.250
<i>--Let's go! Shine towards the future, melodies</i>

00:03:15.250 --> 00:03:17.670
<i>--Yes, I know I'm not alone</i>

00:03:17.670 --> 00:03:20.340
<i>You're all always by my side</i>

00:03:20.340 --> 00:03:26.390
<i>So let's connect our dreams together</i>

00:03:29.640 --> 00:03:32.520
Of course, we have things we want to do.

00:03:32.520 --> 00:03:36.230
Well, we're school idols, so of course
we want to do live performances.

00:03:36.230 --> 00:03:38.900
And we haven't done any together yet.

00:03:38.900 --> 00:03:42.490
Let's all brainstorm what kind of
live performances we want to do.

00:03:42.490 --> 00:03:45.160
Kasumin's vote is for a national tour!

00:03:45.160 --> 00:03:47.910
I want all of us to hold hands
and dance in a giant circle.

00:03:47.910 --> 00:03:50.910
How about we put on little skits
in between the songs?

00:03:50.910 --> 00:03:53.580
I'd really like to include naptimes, please.

00:03:53.580 --> 00:03:56.710
I want everyone to have
what they love explode on stage!

00:03:56.710 --> 00:03:59.170
Like literally on fire,
using pyros and going kaboom!

00:03:59.170 --> 00:04:05.470
I'm not sure about the pyros...
I think I'd prefer something cuter.

00:04:05.470 --> 00:04:07.300
They're getting really heated.

00:04:07.300 --> 00:04:12.060
You're all saying completely different things,
but you're so passionate!

00:04:13.140 --> 00:04:15.850
Wait. Did I say something bad?

00:04:15.850 --> 00:04:17.150
No...

00:04:18.730 --> 00:04:21.280
So, what do you two want to do?

00:04:22.400 --> 00:04:28.660
Hm... I'm not sure.
I just want to do something fun.

00:04:29.950 --> 00:04:31.910
That's a good point.

00:04:31.910 --> 00:04:32.830
Yes.

00:04:32.830 --> 00:04:35.920
Though we might not be able to
attract that many people in the beginning,

00:04:35.920 --> 00:04:39.840
I eventually hope we'll be able to
perform in front of huge crowds.

00:04:39.840 --> 00:04:45.630
Ahem... We can talk about
live performances later, but first...

00:04:45.630 --> 00:04:48.850
We need to train! No matter what
kind of performances we want to do,

00:04:48.850 --> 00:04:52.520
they have to be wonderful,
or our fans are going to be disappointed.

00:04:52.520 --> 00:04:55.310
Training? Like singing and dancing?

00:04:55.310 --> 00:04:56.940
Dancing, huh...

00:04:56.940 --> 00:05:00.230
I'd like to practice singing first.

00:05:00.230 --> 00:05:02.440
Then why don't we split up into groups

00:05:02.440 --> 00:05:05.950
to practice what we specifically
want to for a while?

00:05:05.950 --> 00:05:07.530
That's a great idea!

00:05:07.530 --> 00:05:10.200
Do you mind if we participate in all of them?

00:05:10.200 --> 00:05:11.790
Please do!

00:05:11.790 --> 00:05:14.080
This is so exciting!

00:05:14.080 --> 00:05:15.000
Right?

00:05:15.000 --> 00:05:16.370
Yeah.

00:05:19.790 --> 00:05:21.550
I think you can go further.

00:05:21.550 --> 00:05:24.050
Nope, nope, nope...

00:05:27.970 --> 00:05:30.180
Is that really her limit?

00:05:30.180 --> 00:05:32.140
Looks like it.

00:05:34.310 --> 00:05:38.150
If you're going to dance,
we need to make you more flexible.

00:05:38.150 --> 00:05:40.810
Thank goodness you're
helping us out, Karin-chan.

00:05:40.810 --> 00:05:43.780
Well, I had some spare time.

00:05:43.780 --> 00:05:46.320
All right, let's continue.

00:05:46.320 --> 00:05:48.610
You're going to break poor little Kanata-chan.

00:05:48.610 --> 00:05:50.320
Don't worry.

00:05:53.450 --> 00:05:55.500
Huh...

00:05:55.500 --> 00:06:00.080
Hup. All right, let's give it another shot.

00:06:00.080 --> 00:06:02.750
Take a deep breath in.

00:06:04.420 --> 00:06:06.720
And breathe out slowly.

00:06:14.260 --> 00:06:17.850
See? Isn't it fun when you get the hang of it?

00:06:17.850 --> 00:06:20.850
Keep this up, and you'll get even more flexible!

00:06:20.850 --> 00:06:22.820
Okay. I'll do my best.

00:06:22.820 --> 00:06:25.360
No wonder she's the Club Building Hero.

00:06:25.360 --> 00:06:26.610
Hero?

00:06:26.610 --> 00:06:27.780
You've never heard of her?

00:06:27.780 --> 00:06:33.530
She's pretty famous because she
goes around helping various sports clubs.

00:06:33.530 --> 00:06:35.290
I see.

00:06:35.290 --> 00:06:41.790
By the way, I totally thought you were
joining our club, Karin-chan.

00:06:42.580 --> 00:06:44.800
Of course I'm not.

00:06:44.800 --> 00:06:48.340
I just didn't want to see Emma sad anymore.

00:06:48.340 --> 00:06:50.050
Oh, really...

00:06:50.050 --> 00:06:52.180
Wh-What?

00:06:52.180 --> 00:06:53.760
Thanks.

00:06:54.970 --> 00:06:56.970
It's no big deal.

00:06:59.350 --> 00:07:01.400
Ahem.

00:07:01.400 --> 00:07:04.730
We will now begin our lecture!

00:07:04.730 --> 00:07:06.400
Ooh, this sounds fun!

00:07:06.400 --> 00:07:08.570
Where'd you get those glasses?

00:07:08.570 --> 00:07:11.610
I borrowed them from Setsuna-senpai.

00:07:11.610 --> 00:07:12.780
Without permission.

00:07:12.780 --> 00:07:14.660
You know she's going to get mad, right?

00:07:14.660 --> 00:07:18.080
Let's not go off topic, Osaka-kun!

00:07:18.080 --> 00:07:21.670
Now tell me, what do school idols need?

00:07:21.670 --> 00:07:26.880
U-Um... the ability to express themselves?

00:07:26.880 --> 00:07:28.210
Correct.

00:07:28.210 --> 00:07:30.260
Oh, it is?

00:07:30.260 --> 00:07:35.050
Now, I'll ask you the same question,
Tennoji-kun. What is your answer?

00:07:36.760 --> 00:07:40.100
The ability to connect with fans?

00:07:40.100 --> 00:07:41.560
Correct.

00:07:41.560 --> 00:07:43.350
I guess there's more than one answer.

00:07:43.350 --> 00:07:46.360
Lastly, Miyashita-kun!

00:07:46.360 --> 00:07:50.110
Yeah, sorry. I have no idea.

00:07:50.110 --> 00:07:54.110
Ding, ding, ding! That's also correct!

00:07:54.110 --> 00:07:55.280
How?!

00:07:55.280 --> 00:08:00.330
What's this? You don't know why, Shizuko?

00:08:00.330 --> 00:08:04.380
This question never had a solid answer.

00:08:04.380 --> 00:08:09.550
If it's something that would make
the fans happy, any answer is correct!

00:08:09.550 --> 00:08:12.800
Wow, that's deep.

00:08:14.090 --> 00:08:15.680
You pass!

00:08:21.890 --> 00:08:24.100
That was awful!

00:08:24.100 --> 00:08:26.110
Nah, that's not true.

00:08:26.110 --> 00:08:26.940
Yeah.

00:08:26.940 --> 00:08:30.230
I also love your singing voice, Ayumu-san.

00:08:30.230 --> 00:08:35.320
For the time being, we need to work on
you being able to relax when you sing.

00:08:35.320 --> 00:08:37.120
Yeah...

00:08:37.120 --> 00:08:38.870
You sounded really cute!

00:08:38.870 --> 00:08:41.080
R-Really?

00:08:41.080 --> 00:08:45.420
But I had no idea a place like this
existed at our school.

00:08:45.420 --> 00:08:47.880
Well, this is a recording booth
that's usually used

00:08:47.880 --> 00:08:50.710
by those taking AV courses and clubs.

00:08:50.710 --> 00:08:53.090
Who would like to sing next?

00:08:53.090 --> 00:08:55.630
I wanna hear you sing, Setsu!

00:08:55.630 --> 00:08:58.760
Setsu? Are you referring to me?

00:08:58.760 --> 00:09:01.060
Yeah! That's your nickname.

00:09:01.060 --> 00:09:03.430
Aw, no fair. What's mine?

00:09:03.430 --> 00:09:04.690
Yuyu.

00:09:04.690 --> 00:09:06.100
Then what about me?

00:09:06.100 --> 00:09:08.230
Ayu-bun.

00:09:08.230 --> 00:09:10.570
No more buns, please!

00:09:10.570 --> 00:09:13.860
Aw, but it's so cute.

00:09:13.860 --> 00:09:16.070
Th-That's...

00:09:16.070 --> 00:09:19.700
That's the ending theme
for that anime that just started.

00:09:19.700 --> 00:09:22.290
Are you watching this series?

00:09:22.290 --> 00:09:25.580
Yeah, I've been watching it since I was little.

00:09:27.330 --> 00:09:29.880
Did you see episode 29 of the last series?!

00:09:29.880 --> 00:09:32.590
Jackal tried to sacrifice themselves
by throwing themselves into the magma,

00:09:32.590 --> 00:09:34.800
but then Cosmos embraces them tightly!

00:09:34.800 --> 00:09:36.430
It was super hot.

00:09:36.430 --> 00:09:39.300
--I know, right?! Oh, and then
in episode 47, Jackal...

00:09:39.300 --> 00:09:41.890
--So you like anime, Setsuna-chan...

00:09:41.890 --> 00:09:42.850
Huh?!

00:09:42.850 --> 00:09:46.440
Y-Yes... Though my parents
forbid me from watching,

00:09:46.440 --> 00:09:48.940
so I just sneak around at night to watch it...

00:09:48.940 --> 00:09:51.020
Are your parents strict?

00:09:51.020 --> 00:09:53.900
Well, if I had to choose...

00:09:53.900 --> 00:09:56.450
So that's why you were hiding your identity.

00:09:56.450 --> 00:09:58.240
Identity?

00:10:00.620 --> 00:10:04.370
Oh, wait. Are you the student council president?

00:10:04.370 --> 00:10:06.620
--Yes...
--Oh, I see.

00:10:06.620 --> 00:10:08.460
Jeez, you should've just said so!

00:10:08.460 --> 00:10:10.920
Thanks for the other day.

00:10:10.920 --> 00:10:12.130
Oh, it was nothing...

00:10:12.130 --> 00:10:16.470
I guess I'll have to check out
that anime you guys are watching, too.

00:10:16.470 --> 00:10:21.550
It sounds like a lot of fun after
hearing you get so excited about it.

00:10:23.140 --> 00:10:24.810
It is!

00:10:24.810 --> 00:10:29.400
All right, then let's just
keep singing anime songs today!

00:10:29.400 --> 00:10:31.310
Yeah!

00:10:35.530 --> 00:10:36.900
It's good!

00:10:36.900 --> 00:10:39.490
They're pickles made from
my grandma's special <i>nuka</i> blend.

00:10:39.490 --> 00:10:42.320
It does taste like some nice grandma made them.

00:10:42.320 --> 00:10:43.660
Right?

00:10:43.660 --> 00:10:46.870
Ack, what is this smell?

00:10:46.870 --> 00:10:48.410
Want some?

00:10:48.410 --> 00:10:49.960
--Yeah, I'll have some.
--Welcome back.

00:10:49.960 --> 00:10:52.210
--You guys done with your lessons?
--Yes.

00:10:52.210 --> 00:10:55.750
Kanata-chan here is definitely pooped.

00:10:55.750 --> 00:10:57.460
I guess we're done for today.

00:10:57.460 --> 00:10:59.130
Oh, Kasumi-san.

00:10:59.130 --> 00:11:02.090
I'd like to have a word with you,
so could you stay a while longer?

00:11:02.090 --> 00:11:06.270
I-If this is about your glasses again,
I already apologized so many times!

00:11:06.270 --> 00:11:08.680
That's not it...

00:11:10.060 --> 00:11:13.190
Are we getting together this Saturday, too?

00:11:13.190 --> 00:11:15.900
Yup. We're going jogging in Odaiba.

00:11:15.900 --> 00:11:17.780
Jogging, huh?

00:11:17.780 --> 00:11:19.650
I'll run with you guys, too.

00:11:19.650 --> 00:11:22.160
It feels great to run.

00:11:22.160 --> 00:11:24.990
Do you have Drama Club after this, Shizuku-chan?

00:11:24.990 --> 00:11:25.830
Yes.

00:11:25.830 --> 00:11:28.700
Must be hard doing two clubs.

00:11:28.700 --> 00:11:31.370
Well, I really love both, so...

00:11:31.370 --> 00:11:34.420
Are you still helping out with
the sports clubs, Ai-chan?

00:11:34.420 --> 00:11:38.460
Of course! So I might be a bit late tomorrow.

00:11:38.460 --> 00:11:41.720
You two are working so hard.

00:11:42.760 --> 00:11:44.600
How do you like the club so far?

00:11:45.970 --> 00:11:47.310
It's fun.

00:11:48.810 --> 00:11:54.020
I've never seen Rinari so excited before.
I'm totes having fun, too!

00:11:54.020 --> 00:11:58.440
I'm sorry. I'm not very good at
expressing how I feel.

00:11:58.440 --> 00:12:01.780
No, it's okay. I'm just glad you're having fun.

00:12:01.780 --> 00:12:04.910
But really, you guys are doing
so many things other clubs aren't doing

00:12:04.910 --> 00:12:06.450
that it's so refreshing!

00:12:06.450 --> 00:12:08.330
Is it that different?

00:12:08.330 --> 00:12:13.540
It is! Kasumin said that all of our answers
were correct about being idols,

00:12:13.540 --> 00:12:16.170
but she's right.

00:12:16.170 --> 00:12:18.130
You're all so different,

00:12:18.130 --> 00:12:23.260
but you're all so kind and fun
that it's awesome.

00:12:23.260 --> 00:12:27.180
I'm getting super excited just thinking about

00:12:27.180 --> 00:12:30.890
what kind of concert we can put on together.

00:12:30.890 --> 00:12:33.190
You're really sharp, Ai-chan.

00:12:33.190 --> 00:12:34.230
Huh?

00:12:34.230 --> 00:12:39.980
We all know it. There's something
we have to think about first.

00:12:41.490 --> 00:12:43.990
Solo idols?

00:12:43.990 --> 00:12:47.490
This is a step in a new direction
that only we can do.

00:12:47.490 --> 00:12:51.830
All of us standing
on that stage as solo idols...

00:12:51.830 --> 00:12:56.290
I'm sure we've all thought about this option.

00:12:56.290 --> 00:13:02.210
Yes. But that's easier said than done.

00:13:03.720 --> 00:13:06.720
Standing on stage by myself?

00:13:06.720 --> 00:13:09.560
I'd really have to think about that.

00:13:09.560 --> 00:13:12.890
If we stand up there as a group,
we can help each other out,

00:13:12.890 --> 00:13:17.980
but if we're all solo idols,
no one will be able to help us.

00:13:17.980 --> 00:13:20.730
To be honest, I'm worried.

00:13:20.730 --> 00:13:26.450
Will I be able to do something
on my own that everyone will enjoy?

00:13:31.120 --> 00:13:34.870
It'd be so much easier if
there was only one right answer.

00:13:40.210 --> 00:13:41.590
Ai-chan!

00:13:41.590 --> 00:13:44.260
Sports have rules.

00:13:45.670 --> 00:13:51.390
But when it comes to the school idols
that we want to be, those rules don't exist.

00:13:51.390 --> 00:13:53.140
We're on our own.

00:13:54.980 --> 00:14:00.020
I wonder what kind of
school idol I can be alone.

00:14:00.020 --> 00:14:03.650
What exactly is the right answer for Ai-san?

00:14:04.690 --> 00:14:09.200
I don't think I've ever
thought about this before.

00:14:13.330 --> 00:14:18.500
We'll be meeting at Rainbow Park
at 9 AM tomorrow for our jog!

00:14:18.500 --> 00:14:19.830
Roger!

00:14:21.040 --> 00:14:22.840
Okay!

00:15:12.760 --> 00:15:14.970
I still have an hour...

00:15:34.160 --> 00:15:35.330
Emma-chi!

00:15:35.330 --> 00:15:37.240
Oh, Ai-chan.

00:15:37.240 --> 00:15:38.620
What's up?

00:15:38.620 --> 00:15:42.540
I just woke up super early.
What about you, Ai-chan?

00:15:42.540 --> 00:15:43.830
Same.

00:15:45.460 --> 00:15:49.130
Were you surprised when we
mentioned solo idols yesterday?

00:15:50.590 --> 00:15:56.890
Yeah, but... I think I was
most surprised about myself.

00:15:56.890 --> 00:15:59.560
The thing you guys are worried about

00:15:59.560 --> 00:16:03.100
is if you're going to be able to
fully express yourselves, right?

00:16:03.100 --> 00:16:06.570
I've helped with lots of clubs before,

00:16:06.570 --> 00:16:11.200
but then I realized they were all clubs
where everyone worked as a team.

00:16:11.200 --> 00:16:14.990
Man, this is super hard.

00:16:19.160 --> 00:16:21.620
Solo idols...

00:16:27.340 --> 00:16:29.510
We should probably get going.
We don't wanna ride solo.

00:16:30.460 --> 00:16:33.510
<i>Nein</i>, right? Nine's when
we're supposed to start.

00:16:35.720 --> 00:16:37.350
What's wrong?

00:16:40.390 --> 00:16:42.600
Man, that's hilarious!

00:16:42.600 --> 00:16:44.100
I was talking about solo idols
and you said ride solo!

00:16:44.100 --> 00:16:47.560
Then you topped it off with <i>nein</i> and nine!

00:16:47.560 --> 00:16:48.980
Those are puns, right?

00:16:48.980 --> 00:16:51.740
Puns...? Oh...

00:16:51.740 --> 00:16:53.320
Man, those were awesome!

00:16:53.320 --> 00:16:55.990
I didn't even notice...

00:17:02.500 --> 00:17:05.580
I'm so happy you joined
the School Idol Club, Ai-chan.

00:17:05.580 --> 00:17:07.540
Huh? Why's that?

00:17:07.540 --> 00:17:10.130
Because you're so positive.

00:17:10.130 --> 00:17:13.550
Really? I'm seriously trying to figure out
what I want to do right now, though.

00:17:13.550 --> 00:17:17.590
But when we're all together, you always
look like you're having so much fun.

00:17:18.510 --> 00:17:22.100
We've been through a lot lately...

00:17:22.100 --> 00:17:25.940
...but finally managed to
make it to the starting line.

00:17:25.940 --> 00:17:30.110
I think all of us were really worried,
but at the same time,

00:17:30.110 --> 00:17:35.070
I think we're all equally
looking forward to the future now.

00:17:35.070 --> 00:17:38.570
Otherwise we wouldn't be so worried.

00:17:38.570 --> 00:17:42.910
We just don't have enough courage
to take that first step just yet.

00:17:43.950 --> 00:17:45.330
Ever since you joined,

00:17:45.330 --> 00:17:48.920
everyone in the School Idol Club
is smiling so much more.

00:17:48.920 --> 00:17:51.880
Really? I don't feel like I've done much.

00:17:51.880 --> 00:17:54.130
But that's why you're so amazing.

00:17:54.130 --> 00:17:55.340
Really?

00:17:55.340 --> 00:17:57.010
Yup.

00:18:01.260 --> 00:18:02.970
I see.

00:18:13.070 --> 00:18:16.030
Thanks, Emma-chi! I'm gonna run now!

00:18:16.030 --> 00:18:17.490
Ai-chan?!

00:18:18.700 --> 00:18:21.030
I guess that's all I needed to do.

00:18:21.030 --> 00:18:24.080
I love it when others have so much fun.

00:18:24.080 --> 00:18:27.210
And I love having fun myself!

00:18:27.210 --> 00:18:32.090
Becoming school idols that can understand
that fun and excitement together.

00:18:32.090 --> 00:18:34.050
If we can do that,

00:18:34.050 --> 00:18:38.050
I can finally run down that uncharted path!

00:18:39.010 --> 00:18:41.140
A path filled with so many unknowns!

00:20:37.380 --> 00:20:39.630
We're all in this together.

00:20:39.630 --> 00:20:42.840
We're not completely alone on that stage.

00:20:42.840 --> 00:20:45.720
This is awesome!

00:20:45.720 --> 00:20:50.100
Wow... So that was Ai-chan's performance.

00:20:50.100 --> 00:20:53.480
I want to see all of your performances.

00:20:53.480 --> 00:20:54.690
Even though you're doing this solo,

00:20:54.690 --> 00:20:58.860
it's because you're all individuals
that there are so many possibilities.

00:20:58.860 --> 00:21:01.110
And once you all put on a concert together,

00:21:01.110 --> 00:21:04.740
I think something really amazing will happen!

00:21:05.950 --> 00:21:08.990
You're sort of amazing, Yu-chan.

00:21:10.490 --> 00:21:12.790
I guess I'll have to keep up.

00:21:12.790 --> 00:21:14.250
I'm getting fired up.

00:21:14.250 --> 00:21:15.290
Yeah.

00:21:17.380 --> 00:21:18.750
So am I.

00:21:38.770 --> 00:21:41.570
<i>As we slowly run down this path</i>

00:21:41.570 --> 00:21:45.450
<i>Something is trying to come to life</i>

00:21:45.450 --> 00:21:52.290
<i>I want to tell you, I want to tell you that</i>

00:21:52.290 --> 00:21:55.080
<i>The sky that we look up at every day</i>

00:21:55.080 --> 00:21:59.040
<i>Has a blue that changes with the seasons</i>

00:21:59.040 --> 00:22:05.670
<i>There are no rules, it's telling us</i>
<i>to depict it however we please</i>

00:22:05.670 --> 00:22:07.970
<i>Let's not be in a hurry!</i>

00:22:07.970 --> 00:22:12.430
<i>Let's enjoy this thrilling time even more!</i>

00:22:12.430 --> 00:22:20.520
<i>Let's all pursue the things that we love</i>

00:22:21.440 --> 00:22:24.900
<i>We don't know where we're headed to just yet</i>

00:22:24.900 --> 00:22:27.990
<i>Hopefully, there's an exciting</i>
<i>future awaiting us</i>

00:22:27.990 --> 00:22:32.490
<i>It'd make me happy</i>
<i>if we can both smile about that</i>

00:22:32.490 --> 00:22:35.120
<i>Thank you again today</i>

00:22:35.120 --> 00:22:38.370
<i>Now, let us open up our very own maps</i>

00:22:38.370 --> 00:22:41.540
<i>And casually take flight</i>

00:22:41.540 --> 00:22:46.840
<i>I want to dream, aspire, and dream once again</i>

00:22:46.840 --> 00:22:51.050
<i>I just want to keep dreaming!</i>

00:22:54.350 --> 00:22:57.270
Ayumu! Your cuteness is
only second to your voice.

00:22:57.270 --> 00:22:59.100
You know, because we're second-years!

00:22:59.100 --> 00:23:01.440
Jogging just makes your emotions <i>run</i> high!

00:23:01.440 --> 00:23:03.190
Because you know, jogging!

00:23:04.230 --> 00:23:08.570
We're the School Idol Club
so we can't just wait <i>idoly</i> by.

00:23:09.780 --> 00:23:12.200
Please, stop. I can't anymore...

00:23:12.200 --> 00:23:14.450
She's laughing so hard.

00:23:14.450 --> 00:23:20.170
Yu-chan's sense of humor has been
<i>infantily</i> childish ever since kindergarten.

00:23:20.170 --> 00:23:22.670
Why are you so punny all of a sudden?

00:23:22.670 --> 00:23:25.590
This is all part of our school idol training!

00:23:36.060 --> 00:23:39.390
Next time, "Something I Can Only Do Right Now."
